## Summary

I've successfully researched and compiled **14 AI coding tools** launched between May 6-20, 2026. The products are categorized as follows:

- **3 AI coding CLIs**: ShioriCode, CtrlOps, oh-my-pi
- **4 Open-source/self-hostable agents**: agentmemory, Cplt, codegraph, Pixcode
- **3 Workflow orchestration tools**: CLI-Anything, AgentRail, Prave
- **2 Specific workflow tools**: Haystack (PR review), Drizz (mobile testing)
- **1 IDE-integrated tool**: AIPS
- **1 AI IDE**: Polygram

The list is sorted by a combination of recency, community attention (GitHub trending, Product Hunt launches, Hacker News Show HN), and relevance to AI coding workflows. All products have verified launch dates within the 14-day window and are clearly focused on AI-assisted development workflows.

